171
00:22:06,000 --> 00:22:13,000
The rain became courage. The fear became destiny. The man shivering beneath two blankets became a fearless explorer

172
00:22:13,000 --> 00:22:22,000
staring into the horizon. He may have been fearless, he was still wearing the blankets. So, how did Vikings stay warm on freezing ships? Mostly, they did not

173
00:22:22,000 --> 00:22:29,000
